==Trivia==
*With Sympathy's Japanese name, Magokoro o Neko ni (まごころをネコに, "Sincerely the Cat's"), is a reference to ''Magokoro o, Kimi ni'' (まごころを、君に, "Sincerely Yours"), which is the Japanese title of both ''[[wikipedia:Flowers for Algernon|Flowers for Algernon]]'' and [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_26%27 Episode 26'] of ''[[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]''.

